OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy or
OL,6,Fpartly cloudy during this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight. The showers well scattered
OL,8,Fat first, becoming more widespread and
OL,9,Fheavy around the west coast later in
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FHeavy showers, these merging
OL,13,Fat times with the risk of the odd
OL,14,Fthunderstorm leading to surface water.
OL,15,FBecoming drier and brighter from the
OL,16,Fwest later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
